<title>USA: Farm Family Holdings Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Farm Family Holdings Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>GLENMONT, N.Y. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.31		    $0.47</p>
<p> Net		 1,649		    1,405</p>
<p> Revs		37,817		   34,514</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  5,254		    3,000</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.74		    $3.20</p>
<p> Net		 6,924		    9,606</p>
<p> Revs		146,997		  133,014</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  3,979		    3,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Farm Family Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>Net operating income per share for Q4 1996 was $0.54, compared to $0.31 for the same period in 1995. Full-year net operating income per share for 1996 was $2.42, compared to $3.00 for the year before.</p>
